:: Witch Intro
<<location "prutihut">>
<<set $outside to 0>>
<<callDoll>>
<<prutihairdress>>
<<prutidressup>>
<<npc "Pruti">><<person1>>
You awaken from your stupor feeling oddly... stiff. When you try to move, you hear a sharp click. A cursory glance at your body reveals your skin to be some kind of rubbery false skin. You gasp in horror, but you fail to make a sound. Whatever happened to your body seems to be somewhat impeding your ability to talk. You're about to make an attempt to ascertain your surroundings when you notice a shadow looming over you. You look up.
<br><br>
It takes you a few seconds to mentally grasp what you're seeing. There appears to be a cat<<person>> with a smug expression on <<his>> face standing above you. "Good morning, doll," <<he>> purrs. "It seems the ritual worked perfectly."
<br><br>
The cat<<person>> introduces <<himself>> as Pruti, a powerful witch with a penchant for turning <<his>> enemies into inanimate objects. <<He>> explains that <<he>> conducted a ritual on you to place your soul into a doll, and that you'll remain in this state until <<he>> decides otherwise.
<br><br>
Suddenly, a swarm of elongated arms appear and begin brushing through your hair and face, as if they were getting you ready for your day. "There, there, my little doll," the cat<<person>> whispers. "Now you belong to me. You will do everything I say, understand?"
<br><br>
"Don't worry," <<he>> adds, "I'll take good care of you. I'm sure you'll make a adorable addition to my collection."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut]]>><<set $prutibinding to 12>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Witch Hut
<<set $tiredness -= 1000>>
<<npc "Pruti">><<person1>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	<<towelup>>
<</if>>
<<set $fatigue to 0>>
<<if $prutibinding is 0>>
	<span class="red">
		The bindings slip and break away.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<<elseif $prutibinding lt 3>>
	<span class="pink">
		The bindings feel very loose and nearly fall off.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<<elseif $prutibinding lt 6>>
	<span class="purple">
		The bindings still feel quite firm.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<<elseif $prutibinding lt 10>>
	<span class="blue">
		The bindings hold strong against any struggle you can manage.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<<elseif $prutibinding lt 13>>
	<span class="lblue">
		The bindings are pristine and strong.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<</if>>


<<if $NPCName[$NPCNameList.indexOf("Pruti")].love gte 40 and Time.dayState is "day">>
	<<set $syndromepruti to 1>>
	<<npcincr Pruti dom 1>>
	Suddenly, your bindings loosen and disappear. Pruti approaches you and whispers into your ear. "You've been good thus far. You can move around but don't even think about leaving. Got it?" <<He>> steps back and lets you stand before returning to what <<he>> was doing. <<He>> doesn't seem to mind as you return to your original form.
	<br><br>
	<<sleepDoll>><<stress -1000>>
	<span class="crashpink">You've gained the Stockholm Syndrome: Pruti trait.</span>
	<br><br>
    <<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour gt 6 and Time.hour lte 20 and (V.worn.lower.type.includes("naked") or V.worn.upper.type.includes("naked"))>>
	"My doll, you seem worse for ware. Come, let me get you fixed up." Pruti gently guides you to a chair and sits you with a smirk.
	<br><br>
	"Now hold still, this may take a while."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Sit still (1:00)|Witch Hut Pruti Dress]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour lte 6>>
	You're within a small hut bound among a pile of other dolls. Rain pitter patters against the roof as fire crackles in the corner. The fire looks to be part of a chemistry set? A box of red flame flickers angrily underneath, bubbling some sort of strange liquid above. 
	<br><br>
	Pruti lies still in <<his>> bed asleep. If anything, now is your time to act.
	<br><br>
	<<if $prutibinding gt 0>>
		<<link [[Try to break your bindings (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<set $prutibinding -= 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Flee (0:30)|Witch Hut Flee]]>><<pass 30>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour lte 8 and $prutibinding is 0>>
	You start to fall asleep before you're awaken with a start by Pruti. "What's this?!" <<He>> yells as he finds your bindings broken. "Your bindings broke overnight and... you chose to stay? I... W-wait..." <<He>> seems confused. "Do you not want to be free?" <<He>> mutters confused to <<himself>> as <<he>> fixes your bindings and walks away.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 5>><<set $prutibinding to 12>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour lte 7>>
	
	You're within a small hut bound among a pile of other dolls. Rain pitter patters against the roof as fire crackles in the corner. The fire looks to be part of a chemistry set? A box of red flame flickers angrily underneath, bubbling some sort of strange liquid above. 
	<br><br>
	Pruti is cooking but <<he>> seems apprehensive, it looks like <<he>> is unsure what to add to the meal. 
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Struggle to stand and ask if <<he>> needs help (0:10)|Witch Help Cook]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour lte 8>>
	
	You're within a small hut bound among a pile of other dolls. Rain pitter patters against the roof as fire crackles in the corner. The fire looks to be part of a chemistry set? A box of red flame flickers angrily underneath, bubbling some sort of strange liquid above. 
	<br><br>
	Pruti is sitting, eating a meal of meat and herb. <<He>> seems to wince every few bites due to the bitter taste. 
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Clean up the hut (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 1>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>><<glove>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour is 12>>
	
	Pruti shifts and sits up, stretching <<his>> legs and reaching <<his>> arms high above <<his>> head. <<He>> then grabs a bag from the ground and began filling it with supplies such as food, water, and other essentials. <<He>> was getting ready to go scavenging and was taking you along to keep you from getting any ideas.
	<br><br>
	"Don't even think about trying to escape, doll," <<He>> said as <<he>> places the supplies in <<his>> bag. "I'll be watching you like a hawk."
	<br><br>
	With that, <<he>> picks up the bag and makes <<his>> way towards the door. "Come on, we need to go before the light fades," <<He>> says as <<he>> opens the door and steps outside. You follow <<him>>, feeling somewhat nervous about the whole situation.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Witch Forage]]>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour lte 19>>
	
	You're within a small hut bound among a pile of other dolls. Rain pitter patters against the roof as fire crackles in the corner. The fire looks to be part of a chemistry set? A box of red flame flickers angrily underneath, bubbling some sort of strange liquid above. 
	<br><br>
	Pruti sits idly riding a book. <<He>> occasionally looks up from the book to draw a sigil on the desktop before returning to reading. The entire room has a sort of ominous vibe. 
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Try to spend time with Pruti (1:00)|Witch Hut Pruti Spend]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Clean up the hut (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 1>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>><<glove>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour is 20>>
	
	Pruti gets up and glances your way before walking to the other room and returning with a bucket of water. <<He>> lifts your arm and begins to wash your rubbery false skin.
	<br><br>
	"It's important to stay clean, my doll," <<He>> whispers as <<he>> continues to wipe you down.
	<br><br>
	Pruti pauses before stripping, <<he>> pays no mind to you seeing <<his>> <<if $NPCList[0].penis isnot "none">><<npcPenis>><<elseif $NPCList[0].vagina isnot "none">><<npcVagina>><</if>> as <<he>> begins to wipe down <<his>> own body as well. <<He>> catches your glance and smirks, "Don't be a prude. Where I'm from there's nothing wrong with living naturally." <<He>> finishes wiping down before placing the bucket back into the other room. "I am going to sleep. Don't cause trouble, my doll."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<else>>
	
	You're within a small hut bound among a pile of other dolls. Rain pitter patters against the roof as fire crackles in the corner. The fire looks to be part of a chemistry set? A box of red flame flickers angrily underneath, bubbling some sort of strange liquid above. 
