:: Witch Hut Flee
<<if $bodyless is 1>>
	You free yourself from the vessel and flee the hut.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Misland]]>><<sleepDoll>><<stress -1000>><<set $islanddistance to 45>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You find your body within a closet and return to it before fleeing the hut.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Misland]]>><<sleepDoll>><<stress -1000>><<set $islanddistance to 45>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Witch Forage
Pruti quickly slinks into the forest and out of your sights nearly instantly. The rain pours but you can't really feel it with your rubbery false skin. The sound of animals and nature surround you as you sit and wait for Pruti's return.
<br><br>
<<link [[Try to make a run for it|Witch Run]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Wait (2:00)|Witch Forage End]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 4>><<pass 120>><</link>>

:: Witch Forage End
You wait patiently in the grass. You never actually see any animals, but after two hours Pruti returns with a basket full of herbs and meat. "I hope you weren't too bored, my doll. Good job staying still like I asked." <<He>> doesn't mention anything but <<his>> body seems sore and there's bloodstains on his skin and clothes. "Come now, doll. We're returning to the hut."
<br><br>
Pruti leads you back through the door of the hut and locks you back into your plush corner.
<br><br>
<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Witch Run 
<<set $rng to random(1,100)>>
<<if $rng gte 20>>
	You take start to sprint and try to escape from Pruti. Thorns and branches scratch at you, cutting open your flesh and causing cotton to seep from your wounds.
	<br><br>
	A beast crashes to the ground before you, before standing high on its hind legs. <<His>> body seems all sorts of wrong. Claws match oddly animalistic paws as <<his>> body sprouts fur all the way across. <<His>> fangs are bared sharp and <<his>> animalistic eyes glare at you a brilliant yellow. "You're being a bad doll. I think I need to punish you..." It comes out as a gutteral growl as Pruti's mostly animalistic body twitches and <<his>> pupils shake unsteadily. "Surrender now... Before I tear you apart, little doll."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Surrender|Pruti Punishment]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Fight|Pruti Rape]]>><<npcincr Pruti love -2>><<set $prutimonster to 0>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You take start to sprint and try to escape from Pruti. Thorns and branches scratch at you, cutting open your flesh and causing cotton to seep from your wounds.
	<br><br>
	You make it to Pruti's hut and frantically bar the door. It doesn't take long for the door to start banging as Pruti yells from the other side. "You better open up this door right now, doll! You don't want to get me angry. I'll give you to the count of three!"
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Open the door|Pruti Punishment]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Look for a way to escape|Witch Search]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Witch Search
You search around the hut for anything at all that could be of use.
<br><br>
<<link [[Grab a doll from the pile|Pruti Doll]]>><</link>>
<br>
