:: Pruti Doll
You sense a presence approaching. You dive to the floor just in time as Pruti jumps toward you from the ceiling, cutting off the head of the other doll. <<His>> body seems all sorts of wrong. Claws match oddly animalistic paws as <<his>> body sprouts fur all the way across. <<His>> fangs are bared sharp and <<his>> animalistic eyes glare at you a brilliant yellow. "You're being a bad doll. I think I need to punish you..." It comes out as a gutteral growl as Pruti's mostly animalistic body twitches and <<his>> pupils shake unsteadily. "Surrender now... Before I tear you apart, little doll."
<br><br>
A dark pool of saliva forms on the floor as Pruti starts to lose <<his>> patience. Fleshy tendrils emerge from within <<him>>.
<br><br>
<<link [[Surrender|Pruti Punishment]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Fight|Pruti Rape]]>><<npcincr Pruti love -2>><<set $prutimonster to 0>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>

