:: Witch Hut Trust
<<location "prutihut">>
<<set $outside to 0>>
<<npc "Pruti">><<person1>>

<<if $NPCName[$NPCNameList.indexOf("Pruti")].love gte 60 and Time.dayState is "day" and $portalquest is undefined>>
	<<set $portalquest to 1>>
	Without warning, a purple wisp of light glows around you before forming into a shadowed dark collar around your neck. It gently pulls, dragging you toward the back of the hut.
	<br><br>
	You notice something, a strange doorway that makes no real sense given the structure of the building. It should just lead outside.
	<br><br>
	Yet as you step in, you find yourself in a clean wooden room. The walls feature strange holes, dripping a dark unknowable fluid. Pruti stands in the back wearing what looks like a new outfit.
	<br><br>
	<<His>> old clothes swapped out for a nice formal <<if $pronoun is "m">>suit<<else>>dress<</if>>. "What do you think? Made it myself, you like?"
	<br><br>
	<<He>> gives a small spin, showing off the immaculate stitching and fabric quality. 
	<br><br>
    <<link [[Compliment <<his>> new outfit|Witch New Compliment]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 2>><</link>><<glove>>
	<br>
    <<link [[Say you liked the old one better|Witch New Old]]>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour gt 6 and Time.hour lte 20 and C.npc.Pruti.lust gte 30>>
	<<strip>>
	As you enter the hut, you find it in a state of disarray. Before you even realize it, you are pinned to the floor. Pruti sits atop you, <<his>> eyes with a feral edge.
	<br><br>
	After a pause, Pruti's eyes regain a glint of clarity. <<He>> backs up a bit, holding <<his>> head in pain. "Oh dear, my doll. There is something wrong. I think my faith has been pushed to its limits."
	<br><br>
