:: Pruti Sendoff
Pruti sees you eyeing the door and sighs annoyed. "You do want to leave don't you?" <<He>> grumbles. 
<br><br>
"Look I don't usually do this... but I could free you and let you go." <<He>> seems to be having a hard time getting <<his>> words out. 
<br><br>
"Well, what I mean is I usually don't let my tools go, but as long as you come back I wouldn't... exactly be against it." <<He>> hesitates for a moment before striking you with <<his>> tendril, you feel a sort of severance. 
<br><br>
"Leave now. Before I change my mind."
<br><br>
<<link [[Exit Pruti's Hut|Witch Hut Front]]>><<stress -1000>><<set $islanddistance to 45>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Pruti Eat
You sit together with Pruti. You know you can't eat but you feel <<he>>'ll appreciate the company. You sit together in silence as Pruti eats the dangerously bitter meal before <<he>> finishes and washes the wooden platter.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><<pass 120>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Pruti Massage
You approach Pruti. <<He>> looks exhausted. You sit and begin to rub <<his>> shoulders. <<He>> seems a bit taken aback for a moment before looking away and letting you continue. After a while, <<he>> glances your way before standing. "Thanks for that, my doll. I wasn't expecting it but it was nice."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

