:: Witch Hut Trust Pruti Time
You slide close to Pruti, peeking around <<his>> arm. Pruti seems to be messing with what looks like a Lurker, though unlike the usual specimens, this one is much smaller and white, lacking the carapace they are known for.
<br><br>
"A younger hatchling," Pruti says, sensing your presence. 
<br><br>
<<if $prutiquest gte 7>>
	"Thanks to your help, their numbers have dropped quite a bit. With a sharp drop in viable hosts, most hatchlings don't reach adulthood." <<He>> gently strokes your hair.
	<br><br>
	"You really did good for the remaining lives on this island. I'm proud of you my doll."
<<else>>
	"Since their introduction to the island, the ecosystem has been unable to recover. The wildlife are becoming deformed from the egg laying and most humans avoid these parts of the island altogether."
	<br><br>
	"With the proper drive and assistance, I should be able to help. At least marginally."
<</if>>
<br><br>
You step back and let Pruti return to <<his>> study.
