<<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 3>><</link>><<glove>>

:: Witch New Compliment
"Why thank you, my doll, I think your outfit is quite beautiful as well." <<He>> teases, knowing that the clothes you wear are <<his>> own creation.
<br><br>
"How do you like the room?" <<He>> asks with a tilt of the head, <<his>> cat ears bobbing with gravity. "I was able to complete a spell while meditating that allows me to create subdimensional space."
<br><br>
"A blessing from my goddess, Abyssina. With it, I should be able to assist you, if you would like. A way to link this land and the land beyond. If you assist, I can suprise you with a gift, something for you."
