<<else>>
	<<set $doll to "male">>
<</if>>
<<if $prutiracelose is 1>>
	As you arrive Pruti is waiting with a smirk. "Took you long enough. I've been waiting ages, slow doll."
<<else>>
	You arrive only moments before Pruti. "Wow my doll, I am impressed. You are faster than I thought." <<He>> says this but you can tell <<he>>'s not even breaking a sweat.
<</if>>
<br><br>
"Anyway," Pruti continues, "Come in, I have a present for your hard work." <<He>> snakes in before you, leaving you to enter alone.
<br><br>
As you enter the hut, you are shocked by what you see. Sitting beside Pruti is a lifelike doll of... yourself. Its face, body, everything are identical to your own. Small purple tentacles leak from the joints, thrashing wildly.
<br><br>
"What do you think, perfect isn't it? I took the liberty of studying you greatly while you were under my care. This updated model has built in organic systems that allow dynamic movement, taste and digestion, and even... the ability to have children."
<br><br>
Pruti gives a confident smirk. "Well, my doll? What do you think? You can even change aspects about it you dislike."
<br><br>
<<link [[Say you love it|Pruti Doll Permanent]]>><<set $permadoll to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<span class="black">==Say you don't like it==</span> <span class="red">You cannot deny your master's magnum opus</span>

:: Pruti Doll Permanent
<<callDoll>>
<<prutihairdress>>
<<prutidressup>>
The words leave your lips with ease. <span class="purple">"Yes my owner, I love it."</span>
<br><br>
Pruti presses a shadowed hand to your chest and before you know it, your soul is removed from your mortal vessel. Your body falls to the ground with a thud as your soul is placed into the new vessel.
<br><br>
<span class="red">You feel sick. There is something squirming inside you.</span>
<br><br>
The illness slowly fades as you realize that squirming is part of you. Your new muscles, your new organs. You stumble to your feet with ease, this new body mechanically superior to your old one.
<br><br>
Pruti looks at you with a proud grin. "Well, my doll? How is it." <<He>> gently holds your shoulders and licks your neck.
<br><br>
You can feel it, even in this synthetic form. Though the feeling is dulled. You respond with practiced ease, <span class="purple">"I feel great my owner, this body is perfect."</span>
<br><br>
With your assurance, Pruti lets out a chuckle before nuzzling against you. "That's good to hear, my doll. With this, we are now together, do you understand?"
<br><br>
<<set $prutiromance to 1>>
<<loveInterestAdd "Pruti">>
